{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_06_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4f99fb026db7f8802139c8d2d17afb4d87a85eed9d24e47aa814601466bfe43e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a989dd767703900a51c1c1b5e896b45a9ddccfbb98f471d2c685862faad7df6",
      "text": "练习结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4db090c1793b260f70caf0847513d45d33578917124c1200a8d48a3abb9ffc1",
      "text": "もふもふえん的各位，\n一整天都活力充沛呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e45c8c6f98899c9e6fdfeac5442ce578c8e61f8f331029f5bad22f7e68321f9",
      "text": "哈啊，感觉被折腾得够呛……。\n小孩子的体力还真是有富余呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f969912a73b5bc9754bfc1a14d46ac6dd3846300bfb5f79a89126c3aa78a02c",
      "text": "……。不过，如果我家有个弟弟的话……。\n我家里每天也会那么热闹吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb7f1687e0a6d3c638705d8c7349eb220540587655d3b28a88e5c1390674f47c",
      "text": "虽然会很累，\n但那样说不定也挺开心的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da3fd37ff20095aea309a89863f98698fd6c25664ef3c382461762fd629e085d",
      "text": "……是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29f18fa8044f48dc6219e8e81241688634faa494874a248228870b4c38369e71",
      "text": "哎，姬野君发LINK过来了。\n有什么事呢……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29683a6f70020106b3e50db37b4320a3849ac4a4387f8bbaca4cd7769138e557",
      "text": "怎么了，百百人。有什么顾虑吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7717527bd5e1022c1bde9ee7185cb83a68e19c457d70a3e2edb608202d6317e",
      "text": "……诶嘿嘿。其实我，\n面对年纪小的孩子会有点紧张。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ac79843f183bcc35b34aa6290e6c291c6853000e44ada524160339f45541746",
      "text": "因为不知道他们会突然说什么，\n所以也不知道该怎么做准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cb400516456c2a05ee8a50b1aae00168840fd47401122b6236895e4206fffca",
      "text": "虽说在今天的练习里和三个人稍微拉近了关系，\n但是……直接通电话还是会心跳加速呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000119:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dea82c6cf4ccc0520ef6de96c0f2c08b973645c3502c325c31aaca9f007256c2",
      "text": "呐呐，●●●●プロデューサー！\n你看过LINK上的自我介绍了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000121:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:675d270a1b5392ee939714d522ffc9d9e82a4b0a368685ae2faeeffff33701d8",
      "text": "花音用的是最喜欢的小兔子表情符号哦。\n然后呢，百百人君也用的是一样的呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000123:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:618df6af7a8399873c85aa30a863360d04c540f20b55d58b4ea429e56084fdef",
      "text": "所以花音就跟百百人君拜托，\n希望能和他成为小兔子朋友。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000125:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c0878d4966875aa4d5746755a546f779ad7bee740cf7662a10653172ed1081e",
      "text": "然后百百人君就带着小兔子表情，\n回复我说“请多关照”了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:641d2b626651e9ebf914a092b51c77c540fd02870efa75a7e009815c2e3940d6",
      "text": "而且而且，他还发了好多\n可爱的小鸡贴图给我呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000129:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43b633b1d3ea6d9a93620cb1381c74c6691a187cb9abebec7006229c03e6c531",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿……。能和百百人君\n变得更要好就太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000131:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:979ef0dbde5e4250f2f9527ea709ae78894e3662063d914ae32e81592a3827ba",
      "text": "一定可以的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000133:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c526a7d11a2abe6b10766de9a854c69903c5de6667128c2bc510fac2f86decb",
      "text": "嗯！要变得越来越要好，\n小兔子和小鸡要一起玩耍♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000135:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28eb0e4f8302ce0d85dff69b8ae91a1cd225ed45ce9ef210f82da28cd70bf604",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，谢谢你听花音\n说话。拜拜——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
